        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Stranger-than-heaven-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>At this evening's (or morning's, depending on how you look at things) Xbox Presents, we got a very in-depth look at Ryu Ga Gotoku's upcoming title, <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/stranger-than-heaven\">Stranger Than Heaven</a>. The game, which takes place in five different eras of modern Japanese history - that's 1915, 1929, 1943, 1951 and 1965 - will follow the lifelong friendship of a pair of protagonists and examine how that friendship holds up in the rapidly changing context of the country's vast and complicated 20th Century.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/stranger-than-heaven-combat-explained\">Read more</a></p>",
